---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Creations · Jake DevWorks" description="A home for Jake Ardoin’s 3D designs, printed pieces, and future HeyGears creations.">
  <SiteHeader article/>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="collection-intro wrap" aria-labelledby="creations-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">JAKE DEVWORKS / CREATIONS</p>
        <h1 id="creations-title">Ideas you<br>can <em>hold.</em></h1>
        <p class="collection-lead">From a first sketch to a finished piece.</p>
        <p class="collection-description">A home for my 3D design and printing work—practical pieces, personal projects, and the experiments that lead to something new.</p>
        <a class="button button-gold" href="#workbench">At the workbench <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
      <aside class="maker-mark" aria-label="The making process">
        <span class="eyebrow">DESIGN → PRINT → REFINE</span>
        <span class="maker-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>
        <p>Digital thinking.<br><strong>Physical possibilities.</strong></p>
        <span class="maker-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">CODE / CAD / CREATE</span>
      </aside>
    </section>
    <section class="workbench-section section" id="workbench" aria-labelledby="workbench-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">MADE, TESTED & REFINED</p><h2 id="workbench-title">From the <em>workbench.</em></h2></div>
          <p>The finished pieces,<br>and the process that gets them there.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="workbench-note">
          <span class="workbench-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          <div><h3>The collection is taking shape.</h3><p>I’ll add finished prints, project photos, and design notes here as new pieces are ready. For now, this is the starting point for the work to come.</p></div>
          <a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read the workbench notes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section wrap future-work" aria-labelledby="heygears-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">COMING LATER</p><h2 id="heygears-title">HeyGears<br><em>creations.</em></h2></div>
      <div><p class="large-copy">There’s more to make.</p><p>This space will grow to include my future HeyGears projects, with a closer look at the designs, the process, and the finished pieces.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="collection-contact wrap" aria-labelledby="creation-contact-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">HAVE SOMETHING IN MIND?</p><h2 id="creation-contact-title">Let’s make it <em>real.</em></h2><p>A custom part, a hobby project, or something just for you. Tell me what you’re thinking.</p></div>
      <a class="button button-gold" href="/#contact">Discuss a 3D project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter article/>
</BaseLayout>
